<mxCell id="t" value="OTT PLATFORM (Netflix / Prime / Hotstar) - System Context" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a237e" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="20" width="1580" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="subtitle" value="CDN-first architecture: 95% traffic served from edge → ABR streaming (HLS/DASH) → Content pipeline (Chunker → Encoder → S3) → 200M users, 15M concurrent streams" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#e8eaf6;align=center;rounded=1;fontSize=13" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="65" width="1500" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="boundary" value="OTT STREAMING PLATFORM" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=4;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;spacingLeft=15" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="140" width="1000" height="640" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="user" value="USER SERVICE&#10;&#10;Registration&#10;Login/Auth (JWT)&#10;Profile mgmt" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#bbdefb;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="350" y="195" width="180" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="subscription" value="SUBSCRIPTION&#10;&#10;Plans (Basic/Premium)&#10;Payment (Stripe)&#10;Concurrent limits" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="195" width="180" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="search" value="SEARCH SERVICE&#10;&#10;Full-text search&#10;Genre filters&#10;Elasticsearch index" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="195" width="180" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="play" value="PLAY SERVICE&#10;&#10;Manifest fetch&#10;DRM license&#10;ABR streaming&#10;Heartbeat tracking" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffcc80;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1010" y="195" width="180" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="ingestion" value="CONTENT INGESTION&#10;&#10;Chunker (10s segments)&#10;Encoder (4K/1080p/720p/480p)&#10;Manifest creation (HLS/DASH)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="350" y="365" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="principles" value="KEY DESIGN RULES&#10;&#10;1. CDN-first architecture: 95% of video traffic served from CDN edge (CloudFront 200+ global PoPs). User in Mumbai gets segments from Mumbai edge ~5ms, not from Virginia S3 ~200ms. Only 5% cache misses hit origin S3. Without CDN: S3 cannot handle 2.5M segment requests/sec globally, latency kills user experience.&#10;&#10;2. Adaptive Bitrate Streaming (ABR): Client measures bandwidth every 6-10 seconds, requests segments at matching quality (4K/1080p/720p/480p). HLS (Apple) or DASH (Android/Web). Video never buffers — auto-downgrade to 480p on slow internet, auto-upgrade to 4K when bandwidth recovers. Without ABR: single bitrate → constant buffering on variable networks.&#10;&#10;3. Content ingestion pipeline: Backend team uploads 100GB master file → Chunker splits into 10-second segments → Encoder makes 4 quality versions per chunk → S3 stores all encoded files → Manifest URL saved in MongoDB. All async via Kafka. Without pipeline: users would get raw 100GB file (unplayable), no quality switching, no resumable playback.&#10;&#10;4. Manifest-based streaming: Manifest file (.m3u8 HLS / .mpd DASH) is table of contents listing all segments in order. Client fetches manifest once, then pulls segments sequentially. Cached in Redis 1 hour. Without manifest: client has no idea which segment comes next, cannot seek forward/backward in video.&#10;&#10;5. DRM encryption prevents piracy: Widevine (Google), FairPlay (Apple), PlayReady (Microsoft). Every segment encrypted with unique key. Only paying subscribers get decryption license. License server validates JWT + subscription status before issuing key. Without DRM: content easily ripped and shared.&#10;&#10;6. Concurrent stream limits enforced by Redis atomic INCR: Basic plan allows 1 stream, Premium allows 4. On play start: Redis INCR active_streams:{userId}. If count exceeds plan limit → reject with 429 Too Many Streams. On play stop: DECR. Atomic operations prevent race conditions. Without atomic INCR: users exceed plan limits by starting streams simultaneously." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3e0;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="350" y="520" width="940" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="viewers" value="VIEWERS&#10;&#10;📱 Mobile (iOS/Android)&#10;💻 Web (Chrome/Safari)&#10;📺 Smart TV (Roku/Fire)&#10;🎮 Console (Xbox/PS5)&#10;&#10;200M subscribers&#10;15M concurrent streams" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#bbdefb;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="180" width="200" height="185" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="v-edge" value="HTTPS API" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#1976d2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="viewers" target="boundary"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="backend" value="BACKEND TEAM&#10;&#10;Content upload&#10;Studio master files&#10;(100GB raw videos)&#10;&#10;NOT end users!&#10;Internal team only" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="405" width="200" height="155" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b-edge" value="Admin API" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;dashed=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="backend" target="boundary"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="cdn" value="CDN EDGE&#10;&#10;CloudFront / Akamai&#10;200+ global PoPs&#10;Video segments cached&#10;TTL: 7 days&#10;95% cache hit rate&#10;~5ms latency" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fce4ec;strokeColor=#c2185b;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1380" y="140" width="200" height="175" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cdn-edge" value="Video traffic" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#c2185b;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="boundary" target="cdn"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s3" value="S3 STORAGE&#10;&#10;Encoded segments&#10;Manifest files&#10;Thumbnails&#10;500 PB total&#10;11 nines durability" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffebee;strokeColor=#c62828;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1380" y="360" width="200" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s3-edge" value="Origin (5% miss)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#c62828;dashed=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="boundary" target="s3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="stripe" value="STRIPE / RAZORPAY&#10;&#10;Payment gateway&#10;Card processing&#10;Webhooks&#10;PCI compliance" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1380" y="550" width="200" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="stripe-edge" value="Payment API" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#388e3c;dashed=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="boundary" target="stripe"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="analogy" value="BEGINNER ANALOGY: The platform is a global cinema chain with 200 locations (CDN PoPs). When you press Play in Mumbai, you don't wait for a film reel to ship from Hollywood (S3 Virginia) — the local cinema (Mumbai CDN edge) already has a copy cached on-site, starts playing in 5ms. The Subscription Service is the ticket counter: Basic ticket = 1 seat (1 concurrent stream), Premium ticket = 4 seats (4 streams). Your phone measures the projection quality every few seconds (ABR bandwidth check) — if the screen is blurry (slow internet), the projectionist switches to standard definition automatically (480p) so the film never pauses. The Content Ingestion team is the studio: they send one master film (100GB raw), the distribution center (Chunker) cuts it into 720 reels (10-second segments), the lab (Encoder) makes 4 print qualities (4K/1080p/720p/480p), trucks deliver to all 200 locations (S3 → CDN), and the catalog (MongoDB manifest URL) tells each cinema which reel to play next. DRM is the anti-piracy watermark — only paying ticket-holders (valid JWT + subscription) can enter the projection room. The heartbeat is you pressing a button every 30 seconds to confirm you're still watching — if you stop pressing, the system knows you left and frees up your seat for someone else (DECR concurrent streams)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1f5fe;strokeColor=#0277bd;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="840" width="1530" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
